// The hooks fire: full Core calls none of PrimIO's pointer operations (the
// null pointer, the test of null, the casts) and not Prelude.IO's read of a
// string handle, which base's getEnv makes. A name in braces after what a
// call became is the definition it stands for, not a call.
// CHECK-NOT: {{(PrimIO.prim__(castPtr|forgetPtr|getNullAnyPtr|nullAnyPtr)|Prelude.IO.prim__getString)[ ([]}}
